Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||08-11-2000||12:11 AM||||well, about an hour ago i was cruising around - slept in until about 5:00 (went to six flags, got home around 3:00 am) and was getting stir crazy- needed to unwind, ya know? well, anyways I pull up at a light and im just kinda sitting there, minding my own business, and what pulls up next to me? a heavily tinted mid 90's mustang gt! well, im not in the mood to instigate a street race so i ignore him, but he starts revving the crap out of it, so i figure "hey, its a straight line, but why not?" never risk unless your willing to lose, i say. well, the light turns green and i launcgh pretty hard, off idle, and vault forward. i hear a little squeal from the poontang, but i already have 3/4's of a car. i shift my car a 5400 and smile more as the tires chirp satisfyingly, and i tell myself how great i am, and i see in my peripheral vision the mustang pulling up, we're close to about 55, shift to third, and i start pulling. at this point, i double tap my brakes and slow down, not really wanting to run a red light. i try to wave to the mustang driver, but he doesnt roll down his heavily tinted windows so i cant see him. end of the street action. <BR>WELL<BR>about 20 minutes later, i am at carls junior, getting a gigantor super huge megalith soda, and the guy at the drivethrough window looks my car up and down, and asks "whats the engine?" and i say "stock 2.8 v6" he hands me my change, and turns away- the other person inside the window and says "is that him?" and i think "hmmmm". as i leave the drive thru, sure enough, theres that black mustang! now, i think the car was a gt, due to the GT badges in their proper locations, but it did sound kinda funny. i don't claim to have a car faster than the GT, but i do take pride in my reaction times and my ability to shift quickly and smoothly. fieros kick A55! and no, i am not lying. if the race persisted much longer, he would have pulled ahead. skill can only do so much, and i am far from being an awesome driver, just pretty good for an 18 year old (i think?)<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1012904&a=7460599&p=25516673"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||My7Fieros||08-11-2000||12:49 AM||||Be careful racing on public streets...not a good idea.<BR>Ok, enough of that, WAY TO GO! Im sick of these people in their Mudstains five point slow thinking theyve got the greatest thing on wheels  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  F-em!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
