Z||000008||Shaun41178||08-11-2000||01:00 PM||||Nice kill Stetz!!  When I was first reading it I thought to myself that you have a 3.4 in it.  After further reading of the "2.8"  i started laughing my @ss off!!  That is cool.  With my 2.8 auto 85 Gt I was almost able to keep up with a 96 Gt convertible.  He only pulled like 2 cars on me up to 75 but a non-convertible beat me pretty bad.  This was without my nitrous however.<P>I do think it was a Gt you raced cause if it was a V6 Mustang you would have whooped it bad.  He wouldn't have been able to come close to pulling even with you ever.  V6 stangs are like 17 second cars.<P>Oh yea I like your sig with the burnout there.  Its a good pic.<P>------------------<BR>Shaun-Toledo OH, 85 GT<BR>3.2 With nitrous<BR>http://members.aol.com/shaun41178||||reg||1
